# Daily/weekly/monthly runtime output (2026-09-10, owner-approved).
# `daily_manifest.json` is a runtime pointer (latest_run_id / period / triplet),
# not a decision record: it changes on every run by design, so tracking it made
# the worktree dirty every night while adding no evidence. Per-run report dirs
# (`assurance/runs/<UTC timestamp>/`) are output of the same kind. Historical
# copies that were committed earlier stay tracked as evidence; the ledger files
# that ARE evidence (ledger.json, legacy_periods.json, rollback_manifest.json,
# *_alert.jsonl) also stay tracked.
assurance/runs/daily_manifest.json
assurance/runs/20[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]T*/

# Local historical review clone (ZR-407, 2026-08-18). Kept on disk for reference
# by explicit decision ("不修改/删除"); it is a local checkout of other repos and
# is not part of this repository's content.
.review-zr407-20260818/

# WorkBuddy AI tool data (project-scoped memory + skills). Local tooling state,
# not repository content; regenerated by the tool and never hand-edited.
.workbuddy-ai/

# DWA-04R batch-D dispositions (2026-10-02 owner decision): mutation-scratch
# copies stay on disk uncommitted (seven files hold unique mutated content
# that current worktree cannot rebuild — deletion was NOT chosen), the
# historical plan_inputs backup is kept local, and one-off weekly-run logs
# are regenerable from a rerun. Zero-byte h2 runtime logs are dropped.
.tmp-r41-mutation/
assurance/unified_completion/manifests/plan_inputs.json.bak
assurance/runs/weekly-run-*.log
h2.log
h2.log.err
